At the top of a notebook section \[LongDash] on a virgin kernel this reads \
the notebook's entry from disk and loads it; on a live kernel it re-shows the \
Loaded: panel:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->552,ExpressionUUID->"79aa20d9-b419-450b-a29e-6fffeaadc554"],

